{"real": true, "dur": 116.51, "sent": [{"start": 0.22, "end": 8.68, "text": "Each unit combines linguistic goals and communicative goals, which L’Atelier calls situations.", "words": [{"w": "Each", "s": 0.22}, {"w": "unit", "s": 0.6}, {"w": "combines", "s": 0.92}, {"w": "linguistic", "s": 1.72}, {"w": "goals", "s": 2.36}, {"w": "and", "s": 2.92}, {"w": "communicative", "s": 3.12}, {"w": "goals,", "s": 4.04}, {"w": "which", "s": 5.16}, {"w": "La-tuh-li-eh", "s": 5.82}, {"w": "calls", "s": 7.08}, {"w": "situations.", "s": 7.74}]}, {"start": 9.22, "end": 17.76, "text": "As we’ve just seen, each linguistic goal gets a lesson page, while each situation represents something learners can do with the language.", "words": [{"w": "As", "s": 9.22}, {"w": "we’ve", "s": 9.38}, {"w": "just", "s": 9.74}, {"w": "seen,", "s": 10.06}, {"w": "each", "s": 10.76}, {"w": "linguistic", "s": 11.08}, {"w": "goal", "s": 11.74}, {"w": "gets", "s": 12.04}, {"w": "a", "s": 12.42}, {"w": "lesson", "s": 12.52}, {"w": "page,", "s": 12.86}, {"w": "while", "s": 13.66}, {"w": "each", "s": 13.96}, {"w": "situation", "s": 14.34}, {"w": "represents", "s": 15.0}, {"w": "something", "s": 15.74}, {"w": "learners", "s": 16.16}, {"w": "can", "s": 16.56}, {"w": "do", "s": 16.78}, {"w": "with", "s": 17.0}, {"w": "the", "s": 17.18}, {"w": "language.", "s": 17.3}]}, {"start": 18.7, "end": 23.4, "text": "Sometimes, however, the book packs several things into one situation.", "words": [{"w": "Sometimes,", "s": 18.7}, {"w": "however,", "s": 19.52}, {"w": "the", "s": 20.52}, {"w": "book", "s": 20.64}, {"w": "packs", "s": 20.92}, {"w": "several", "s": 21.26}, {"w": "things", "s": 21.68}, {"w": "into", "s": 22.18}, {"w": "one", "s": 22.52}, {"w": "situation.", "s": 22.76}]}, {"start": 23.82, "end": 28.96, "text": "When it does, I split them up, so each situation has one purpose.", "words": [{"w": "When", "s": 23.82}, {"w": "it", "s": 24.0}, {"w": "does,", "s": 24.12}, {"w": "I", "s": 24.78}, {"w": "split", "s": 24.88}, {"w": "them", "s": 25.2}, {"w": "up,", "s": 25.46}, {"w": "so", "s": 26.26}, {"w": "each", "s": 26.58}, {"w": "situation", "s": 27.04}, {"w": "has", "s": 27.98}, {"w": "one", "s": 28.26}, {"w": "purpose.", "s": 28.52}]}, {"start": 29.84, "end": 31.9, "text": "But how do the two kinds fit together?", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 29.84}, {"w": "how", "s": 30.08}, {"w": "do", "s": 30.38}, {"w": "the", "s": 30.52}, {"w": "two", "s": 30.68}, {"w": "kinds", "s": 30.88}, {"w": "fit", "s": 31.22}, {"w": "together?", "s": 31.44}]}, {"start": 32.759, "end": 33.8, "text": "They meet in a grid.", "words": [{"w": "They", "s": 32.759}, {"w": "meet", "s": 32.96}, {"w": "in", "s": 33.22}, {"w": "a", "s": 33.4}, {"w": "grid.", "s": 33.52}]}, {"start": 34.6, "end": 39.22, "text": "Linguistic goals go down the side, and situations go across the top.", "words": [{"w": "Linguistic", "s": 34.6}, {"w": "goals", "s": 35.18}, {"w": "go", "s": 35.54}, {"w": "down", "s": 35.72}, {"w": "the", "s": 35.98}, {"w": "side,", "s": 36.16}, {"w": "and", "s": 37.08}, {"w": "situations", "s": 37.28}, {"w": "go", "s": 38.2}, {"w": "across", "s": 38.44}, {"w": "the", "s": 38.82}, {"w": "top.", "s": 38.98}]}, {"start": 39.6, "end": 42.22, "text": "Here’s part of Unit 2, for example.", "words": [{"w": "Here’s", "s": 39.6}, {"w": "part", "s": 39.88}, {"w": "of", "s": 40.08}, {"w": "Unit", "s": 40.34}, {"w": "2,", "s": 40.92}, {"w": "for", "s": 41.54}, {"w": "example.", "s": 41.64}]}, {"start": 42.22, "end": 47.56, "text": "“To like the” helps you say what you like, and also say why.", "words": [{"w": "“To", "s": 42.22}, {"w": "like", "s": 43.24}, {"w": "the”", "s": 43.54}, {"w": "helps", "s": 44.14}, {"w": "you", "s": 44.4}, {"w": "say", "s": 44.64}, {"w": "what", "s": 45.18}, {"w": "you", "s": 45.42}, {"w": "like,", "s": 45.6}, {"w": "and", "s": 46.4}, {"w": "also", "s": 46.62}, {"w": "say", "s": 46.98}, {"w": "why.", "s": 47.26}]}, {"start": 48.56, "end": 53.58, "text": "Negation, for its part, turns up in several situations at once.", "words": [{"w": "Negation,", "s": 48.56}, {"w": "for", "s": 49.82}, {"w": "its", "s": 49.98}, {"w": "part,", "s": 50.18}, {"w": "turns", "s": 50.84}, {"w": "up", "s": 51.14}, {"w": "in", "s": 51.36}, {"w": "several", "s": 51.62}, {"w": "situations", "s": 52.02}, {"w": "at", "s": 52.86}, {"w": "once.", "s": 53.16}]}, {"start": 54.06, "end": 63.06, "text": "In other words, one linguistic goal can serve lots of situations, and one situation can need lots of linguistic goals.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 54.06}, {"w": "other", "s": 54.26}, {"w": "words,", "s": 54.52}, {"w": "one", "s": 55.56}, {"w": "linguistic", "s": 55.84}, {"w": "goal", "s": 56.48}, {"w": "can", "s": 57.16}, {"w": "serve", "s": 57.4}, {"w": "lots", "s": 57.7}, {"w": "of", "s": 58.0}, {"w": "situations,", "s": 58.18}, {"w": "and", "s": 59.56}, {"w": "one", "s": 59.76}, {"w": "situation", "s": 60.0}, {"w": "can", "s": 61.0}, {"w": "need", "s": 61.18}, {"w": "lots", "s": 61.42}, {"w": "of", "s": 61.74}, {"w": "linguistic", "s": 61.96}, {"w": "goals.", "s": 62.6}]}, {"start": 63.92, "end": 70.72, "text": "So with the grid, I can see at a glance what a learner needs before tackling each situation.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 63.92}, {"w": "with", "s": 64.36}, {"w": "the", "s": 64.56}, {"w": "grid,", "s": 64.7}, {"w": "I", "s": 65.54}, {"w": "can", "s": 65.64}, {"w": "see", "s": 65.9}, {"w": "at", "s": 66.18}, {"w": "a", "s": 66.32}, {"w": "glance", "s": 66.42}, {"w": "what", "s": 67.22}, {"w": "a", "s": 67.46}, {"w": "learner", "s": 67.6}, {"w": "needs", "s": 68.0}, {"w": "before", "s": 68.64}, {"w": "tackling", "s": 69.08}, {"w": "each", "s": 69.6}, {"w": "situation.", "s": 70.0}]}, {"start": 71.16, "end": 87.32, "text": "This actually brings together two approaches Wilkins talked about: building language up piece by piece, which is the synthetic approach, and starting with what learners need to do, which is the analytic approach.", "words": [{"w": "This", "s": 71.16}, {"w": "actually", "s": 71.7}, {"w": "brings", "s": 72.34}, {"w": "together", "s": 72.68}, {"w": "two", "s": 73.28}, {"w": "approaches", "s": 73.6}, {"w": "Wilkins", "s": 74.32}, {"w": "talked", "s": 74.96}, {"w": "about:", "s": 75.28}, {"w": "building", "s": 76.5}, {"w": "language", "s": 76.96}, {"w": "up", "s": 77.54}, {"w": "piece", "s": 78.1}, {"w": "by", "s": 78.4}, {"w": "piece,", "s": 78.64}, {"w": "which", "s": 79.8}, {"w": "is", "s": 80.06}, {"w": "the", "s": 80.26}, {"w": "synthetic", "s": 80.44}, {"w": "approach,", "s": 81.0}, {"w": "and", "s": 82.24}, {"w": "starting", "s": 82.48}, {"w": "with", "s": 83.04}, {"w": "what", "s": 83.28}, {"w": "learners", "s": 83.56}, {"w": "need", "s": 84.02}, {"w": "to", "s": 84.24}, {"w": "do,", "s": 84.38}, {"w": "which", "s": 85.42}, {"w": "is", "s": 85.66}, {"w": "the", "s": 86.02}, {"w": "analytic", "s": 86.24}, {"w": "approach.", "s": 86.86}]}, {"start": 87.86, "end": 97.0, "text": "Later, Janice Yalden called something similar a proportional syllabus, bringing structure and communication together.", "words": [{"w": "Later,", "s": 87.86}, {"w": "Janice", "s": 88.9}, {"w": "Yalden", "s": 89.32}, {"w": "called", "s": 90.06}, {"w": "something", "s": 90.38}, {"w": "similar", "s": 90.84}, {"w": "a", "s": 91.8}, {"w": "proportional", "s": 91.92}, {"w": "syllabus,", "s": 92.78}, {"w": "bringing", "s": 93.98}, {"w": "structure", "s": 94.42}, {"w": "and", "s": 95.36}, {"w": "communication", "s": 95.64}, {"w": "together.", "s": 96.6}]}, {"start": 97.84, "end": 104.62, "text": "Finally, every unit finishes with one task that uses all its situations.", "words": [{"w": "Finally,", "s": 97.84}, {"w": "every", "s": 99.1}, {"w": "unit", "s": 99.54}, {"w": "finishes", "s": 100.1}, {"w": "with", "s": 100.68}, {"w": "one", "s": 101.02}, {"w": "task", "s": 101.32}, {"w": "that", "s": 102.18}, {"w": "uses", "s": 102.52}, {"w": "all", "s": 103.16}, {"w": "its", "s": 103.52}, {"w": "situations.", "s": 103.82}]}, {"start": 105.2, "end": 107.3, "text": "L’Atelier calls it the Mission.", "words": [{"w": "La-tuh-li-eh", "s": 105.2}, {"w": "calls", "s": 106.16}, {"w": "it", "s": 106.44}, {"w": "the", "s": 106.64}, {"w": "Mission.", "s": 106.82}]}, {"start": 108.3, "end": 115.74, "text": "All in all, in the new plan, the French course has thirty-seven situations and around sixty linguistic goals.", "words": [{"w": "All", "s": 108.3}, {"w": "in", "s": 108.46}, {"w": "all,", "s": 108.66}, {"w": "in", "s": 109.2}, {"w": "the", "s": 109.3}, {"w": "new", "s": 109.46}, {"w": "plan,", "s": 109.66}, {"w": "the", "s": 110.48}, {"w": "French", "s": 110.7}, {"w": "course", "s": 111.1}, {"w": "has", "s": 111.58}, {"w": "thirty-seven", "s": 111.84}, {"w": "situations", "s": 112.52}, {"w": "and", "s": 113.72}, {"w": "around", "s": 113.88}, {"w": "sixty", "s": 114.3}, {"w": "linguistic", "s": 114.68}, {"w": "goals.", "s": 115.32}]}]}